  "description": "CMX Cinemas Pinnacle 14 offers rocker stadium seating to view the latest box office hits with the most up-to-date technologies, including RealD 3D and DBOX motion seating. Visit our concessions stand for cinema classics like fresh popcorn, nachos, hot dogs, candies, soda, and more. CMX Cinemas Pinnacle 14 also offers a selection of beer and wine. The theatre features 14 auditoriums with a capacity of 89-222 people per theatre and reserved seating. CMX Cinemas debuted its first flagship dine-in theatre in April 2017 at Brickell City Centre in Miami, FL, ushering in a new era of sophisticated movie-going. Blending culinary artistry, handcrafted cocktails, and immersive entertainment, CMX transforms a night at the movies into a sensorial experience. Each location showcases chef-driven menus featuring modern New-American cuisine, VIP experiences, and state-of-the-art technology designed to indulge every guest. Select locations also feature the lively CMX Stone Sports Bar, extending the entertainment beyond the screen and making CMX a destination for connection, cuisine, and culture. CMX is one of the largest movie theatre chains in the United States, with 25 locations, over 300 screens and over 2,000 employees.",
